<title>USA: Zurich Centre buys stake in American Sterling unit.</title>
<headline>Zurich Centre buys stake in American Sterling unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich Centre Investments Ltd said Monday it signed a definite agreement to buy a majority interest in privately-held American Sterling Corp's American Sterling Insurance Agency Inc.</p>
<p>Zurich, the private equity investment arm of the Zurich Group of Switzerland, said it will merge the unit with its Zurich Centre Real Estate Solutions and rename the combined entity ZC Sterling Corp.</p>
<p>The companies did not disclose the terms of the deal.</p>
</text>
